{"id":"59f8958c-63eb-466e-a006-74d437cba2df","object":"chat.completion","created":1784806911,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    payload = case['payload']\\n    tokens = list(payload['tokens'])\\n    calls = list(payload['calls'])\\n    # Validate required fields (assume present)\\n    # Sort candidates by descending score, then start asc, then call_id asc\\n    sorted_calls = sorted(calls, key=lambda c: (-c['score'], c['start'], c['call_id']))\\n    selected = []\\n    for call in sorted_calls:\\n        # Check overlap with any already selected\\n        overlap = False\\n        for sel in selected:\\n            if not (call['end'] <= sel['start'] or call['start'] >= sel['end']):\\n                overlap = True\\n                break\\n        if not overlap:\\n            selected.append(call)\\n    # Order accepted calls by source start for reporting\\n    selected_by_start = sorted(selected, key=lambda c: c['start'])\\n    selected_ids = [c['call_id'] for c in selected_by_start]\\n    # Apply replacements from right to left\\n    result_tokens = list(tokens)\\n    for call in sorted(selected, key=lambda c: c['start'], reverse=True):\\n        s = call['start']\\n        e = call['end']\\n        repl = call['replacement_tokens']\\n        result_tokens = result_tokens[:s] + repl + result_tokens[e:]\\n    return {'selected_ids': selected_ids, 'interleaved_tokens': result_tokens}\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) that processes the given case payload. The case has tokens and calls. Each call has call_id, start, end, score, replacement_tokens. The task is to select non-overlapping calls (greedy by descending score, then start, then call_id) and then apply replacements from right to left to produce final interleaved tokens. Return selected IDs and final token stream.\n\nKey details:\n- Greedy selection: sort calls by (-score, start, call_